      "claim": "Caution: complete absorption does not guarantee high F, as BMS-181101 (C165) and ebastine (C180) had complete/well absorption but low F due presystemic metabolism; however, no affirmative first-pass liability is shown for the query, so this remains an evidence gap rather than low-F evidence.",
      "card_ids": ["C165","C180"]
    }
  ],
  "new_evidence_assessment": [
