  "decision_summary": "Predicted high (F>=20%) remains supported and is strengthened by L4 intestinal absorption/permeability evidence: structurally related basic methoxyaryl amines are well or almost completely absorbed, and basic ketone/amine drugs show high Caco-2 permeability. L1 human F values for close analogues remain above 20%. No affirmative low-F evidence is present; ionization/logD concerns are not sufficient to predict low."
}

